Are you writing wiffle ball?
你在写威浮球吗？

247
00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:33.290
Wiffle ball.
威浮球。

248
00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:34.190
Oh, good God.
噢，天哪。

249
00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:34.610
Okay.
