Did Ryan started the fire get stuck in your heads throughout filming this episode?
在拍摄这一集的过程中，《瑞安放了火》这首歌有没有一直萦绕在你们脑海里？

1249
00:45:08.140 --> 00:45:08.580
Yes.
有。

1250
00:45:08.880 --> 00:45:09.160
Yes.
有。

1251
00:45:09.400 --> 00:45:10.860
For days later.
四天后。

1252
00:45:11.040 --> 00:45:14.520
And every time I watch the episode, it gets stuck in my head for a whole rest of the day.
每次我看这一集，它就会在我脑子里挥之不去，整整一天都忘不掉。

1253
